    {
      "content": "The total number of medium- and small-sized scenes required has not been given, so the exact number of days cannot be determined yet.\n\nIf you mean **15 large-sized scenes, 7 medium-sized scenes, and 7 small-sized scenes**, then:\n\n- Large: \\(15 \\div 5 = 3\\) days\n- Medium: \\(7 \\div 7 = 1\\) day\n- Small: \\(7 \\div 7 = 1\\) day\n\nSince Lauren works on them one after another, the total is:\n\n\\[\n3+1+1=\\boxed{5\\text{ days}}\n\\]",
