      "content": "Using Lauren’s daily production rates:\n\n- **Large-sized scenes:**  \n  \\[\n  45 \\div 5 = 9\\text{ days}\n  \\]\n\n- **Medium-sized scenes:**  \n  \\[\n  36 \\div 7 = \\frac{36}{7}=5\\frac{1}{7}\\text{ days}\n  \\]\n\n- **Small-sized scenes:**  \n  \\[\n  49 \\div 7 = 7\\text{ days}\n  \\]\n\nTherefore, the total time is:\n\n\\[\n9+5\\frac{1}{7}+7=21\\frac{1}{7}\\text{ days}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{21\\frac{1}{7}\\text{ workdays}}\n\\]",
